<title>ITALY: Bulgari H1 1996 net earnings triple.</title>
<headline>Bulgari H1 1996 net earnings triple.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30, 1966</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>    Cons net earnings		     18.1 vs    5.9</p>
<p>    Cons net sales			 186.5 vs  154.5</p>
<p>    Cons operating profit		 19.9 vs   11.4</p>
<p>    Pre-tax earnings			24.5 vs    8.4</p>
<p>    Net financial position		36.3 vs (126.4)</p>
<p>    Capital expenditure		   14.0 vs    8.9</p>
<p>    Parent co net earnings		 3.6 vs    n/a</p>
<p>    Parent co revenues		    16.0 vs   15.3</p>
<p>Note - Luxury jewellery group CEO Francesco Trapani said in a statement, &quot;We are extremely satisfied with the positive results achieved in this first half which give us reason to expect a good closure at the end of the year.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129450</p>
</text>
